# ================================
# Vector Store / Generated Data
# ================================
# The persisted ChromaDB index (CHROMA_PERSIST_DIR, default `chroma_db`).
# It's a build artifact — regenerated from the source PDF on first run — and
# contains a SQLite DB plus binary HNSW segments that must never be committed.
chroma_db/
chroma_db*/
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-journal
*.sqlite3-wal
*.sqlite3-shm

# Chroma / local vector database files
chroma/
.chroma/
vector_db/

# Downloaded sentence-transformers / HuggingFace model weights
.cache/huggingface/
models/

# NOTE: Career_Advisor_Guide_2025.pdf is a committed repo asset (the default
# RAG reference document) — deliberately not ignored here.

# ================================
# Uploaded / Staging Documents
# ================================
uploads/
temp_document.pdf
temp_resume.*
*.tmp

# ================================
# LangSmith / Evaluation Artifacts
